{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35460","headline":"长安客舍叙邵陵旧宴寄永州萧使君五首 二 · 曹唐","name":"长安客舍叙邵陵旧宴寄永州萧使君五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不知何路却飞翻，虚受贤侯郑重恩。\n五夜清歌敲玉树，三年洪饮倒金尊。\n招携永感双鱼在，报荅空知一劒存。\n狼籍棃花满城月，当时长醉信陵门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}